<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>

<!--
  <lang>
    <zh-CN>该 Debug 转换模板遵循 Microsoft Web.config Transform 语法；示例说明可参考 https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=125889，实际发布值不得直接从示例复制。</zh-CN>
    <en>This Debug transform template follows Microsoft Web.config Transform syntax; examples are documented at https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=125889, and live deployment values must not be copied directly from samples.</en>
  </lang>
-->

<configuration xmlns:xdt="http://schemas.microsoft.com/XML-Document-Transform">
  <!--
    <lang>
      <zh-CN>连接串示例只演示 SetAttributes 与 Match(name) 定位器的组合；真实 Portal 连接串由外置模板和本地配置提供，不能写回此转换示例。</zh-CN>
      <en>The connection-string sample only demonstrates combining SetAttributes with the Match(name) locator; real Portal connection strings come from the external template and local configuration and must not be written back into this transform sample.</en>
    </lang>
  -->
  <system.web>
    <!--
      <lang>
        <zh-CN>customErrors 示例说明 Replace 可替换 system.web 下唯一的错误处理节点；Debug 模板当前不启用该转换，避免掩盖本地诊断输出。</zh-CN>
        <en>The customErrors sample documents that Replace can swap the single error-handling node under system.web; the Debug template does not enable that transform so local diagnostic output remains visible.</en>
      </lang>
    -->
  </system.web>
</configuration>
